:: win WWP [autosave] {"position":"300,2500","size":"100,100"}
You killed the white wolf pup and won the battle, gaining <<print ($mobLvl*1.5 + $mobXP).toFixed(0)>> XP and $mobCoins Coins<<if $lootchance lte 45>> and Wolf meat.<<elseif $lootchance lte 75>> and Wolf fur.<<elseif $lootchance lte 100>>.<</if>>
<<EventCurrencies>>\
<<link "Go back">>
<<goto $lastVisitedPassage>>
	<<if $lootchance lte 45>>
		<<set $wolfMeat += 1>>
	<<elseif $lootchance lte 75>>
    	<<set $wolfFur += 1>>
	<</if>>
<<set $killedWWP += 1>>
<<set $attack to "Empty">>
<<MobRewards>>
<</link>>


